msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid "A website's logins are offered on that site only: its exact address, or every address under it for *.example.com. For an app, Android autofill saves its verified package and signing identity. An older package-only androidapp:// address is not filled until you explicitly save it for the signer shown by Android."
